title Vinyl P2b: Mount on request (owner, 2026-11-14): the Folders root lists a drive that is plugged in and not mounted (the amber dot, Tap to mount); a tap mounts it (Mounting ..., no password) and opens it (480x320 and 320x480, their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE library
env VINYL_DEMO_DRIVES unmounted
keyboards 1
wait 1200
shot 01-hub
tap "Folders"
wait 700
shot 02-folders-drives
expect text "USB DRIVES"
expect text "Generic Flash Disk"
@480x320,640x480,800x480,480x480,720x720 expect text "not mounted. Tap to mount"
expect text "Music"
tap "Generic Flash Disk"
wait 250
shot 03-mounting
expect text "Mounting Generic Flash Disk..."
wait 900
shot 04-mounted-and-open
expect text "Flash Song"
expect text "GENERIC FLASH DISK"
key backspace
wait 500
shot 05-root-list-mounted
expect text "Music"
expect notext "USB DRIVES"
key esc
wait 500
expect text "Folders"
expect noquit
